{"results":[{"url":"https://houssed.com/mumbai/samarpan-homes-developers/samarpan-om-apartment-2000","title":"Samarpan Om Apartment, Borivali West, Mumbai | 1 & 2 BHK Affordable Apartments | Houssed","raw_content":"[![Houssed](/assets/images/houssed_logo.svg)](/)\n\n[![whatsapp](/assets/images/whatsapp.svg)Connect Now](https://api.whatsapp.com/send/?phone=918169114718&text=Hi%2C+I%27m+looking+to+Buy+a+residential+property+in+Mumbai.+Please+connect+with+me.+Thanks%21&type=phone_number&app_absent=0)\n\n![Project Image of Samarpan Om Apartment in Borivali West, Mumbai - Image 38088](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/2000/Project%20Image/84f1e3d213f17efcfdc78500128310ec.webp)\n\nReady to Move  Affordable\n\n![Project Image of Samarpan Om Apartment in Borivali West, Mumbai - Image 38087](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/2000/Project%20Image/34e9584450e6f57f7d48c4be3481fac5.webp)\n\nReady to Move  Affordable\n\n![Amenities of Samarpan Om Apartment in Borivali West, Mumbai - Image 38089](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/2000/Amenities/6cd7fdb68a54ec01f9a5417a9b11b260.webp)\n\nReady to Move  Affordable\n\n![Sample Apartment of Samarpan Om Apartment in Borivali West, Mumbai - Image 38090](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/2000/Sample%20Apartment/2637b7013e0f3b1e6e5df967bc7ff470.webp)\n\nReady to Move  Affordable\n\n![Sample Apartment of Samarpan Om Apartment in Borivali West, Mumbai - Image 38091](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/2000/Sample%20Apartment/d584f5203347a89e440bc11e5c5bf256.webp)\n\nReady to Move  Affordable\n\n![Sample Apartment of Samarpan Om Apartment in Borivali West, Mumbai - Image 38092](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/2000/Sample%20Apartment/c6aa255df2d33d207a174f90ccb52ebd.webp)\n\nReady to Move  Affordable\n\n![Sample Apartment of Samarpan Om Apartment in Borivali West, Mumbai - Image 38093](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/2000/Sample%20Apartment/47677dd96480b208cbc54caebd0a04c6.webp)\n\nReady to Move  Affordable\n\n![Location of Samarpan Om Apartment in Borivali West, Mumbai - Image 38094](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/2000/Location/734c83b37b27175e76d5eefabfae9811.webp)\n\nReady to Move  Affordable\n\n## Project Overview of Samarpan Om Apartment Borivali West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\nNo. of Units\n\n17 Units\n\nProject Area\n\n0.23 Acres\n\nTowers / Floors\n\n1 Towers / 11 Floors\n\nProperty View\n\nOpen View\n\nParking\n\nTwo Wheeler, Four Wheeler\n\n---\n\nWelcome to Om Apartments, located in the heart of Borivali East, Mumbai, developed by Samarpan Homes and Developers. This property aims to redefine living with its meticulously designed apartments that offer ample space and an array of amenities.  \n  \nThe apartments at Om Apartments result from precise planning and perfect execution, ensuring maximum space utilization. The property boasts a lavish entrance lobby, 24\\*7 security, a gym room, stag parking, and much more. Om Apartments is surrounded by some of the best hospitals, educational institutes, transportation hubs, and entertainment options that are nearby.   \n  \nThe property is near the railway station, WE Highway, Ambe Mata Temple, National Park, Carnival Multiplex, Metro Mall, Jain Temple, and many more landmarks. Om Apartments is the perfect place to call home. It's ideal location, ample amenities, and meticulously designed apartments offer a unique living experience that will exceed your expectations.\n\n## Floor Plans & Pricing of Samarpan Om Apartment Borivali West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n![1 BHK Flat in Samarpan Om Apartment in Borivali West, Mumbai - Image 470093](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/2000/BHK_Configuration/51acbfba805a030bc7c473a444d25ad6.webp)\n\n1 BHK Flat\n\nCarpet Area\n\n412 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n90 Lakh\n\n![2 BHK Flat in Samarpan Om Apartment in Borivali West, Mumbai - Image 470094](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/2000/BHK_Configuration/09bf3ae2c5c66ac2a577b4667c1354fb.webp)\n\n2 BHK Flat\n\nCarpet Area\n\n585 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n1.32 Cr\n\n![2 BHK Flat in Samarpan Om Apartment in Borivali West, Mumbai - Image 470095](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/2000/BHK_Configuration/2687357bb22e45aedea5ff1416142e0d.webp)\n\n2 BHK Flat\n\nCarpet Area\n\n711 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n1.6 Cr\n\n![Floor Plan of Samarpan Om Apartment in Borivali West, Mumbai - Image 38095](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/2000/Floor%20Plan/49da39dc401f75bcfd497fd9821d104d.webp)\n\nFloor Plan\n\n## Key Features of Samarpan Om Apartment Borivali West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n* Prime Location.\n* Modern Amenities.\n* Luxurious & Comfortable Living.\n* Sustainable Living.\n* Tight Security.\n* Stylish Apartment.\n\n## Amenities Samarpan Om Apartment Borivali West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n* Power Back Up\n* Solar Power\n* Meditation Zone\n* Children Playing Zone\n* Senior Citizen Sitting Area\n* Senior Citizens' Walking Track\n* High-Speed Elevators\n* Parking and transportation\n* Society Office\n* Convenience Store\n* Grand Entrance Lobby\n\n* Gymnasium\n* Kids Play Area\n* Indoor Games\n* Jogging Track\n* Cycle Track\n\n* Community Club\n* Indoor Kids' Play Area\n* Indoor Games And Activities\n* Vastu-compliant designs\n* Nature Walkway\n\n* Cctv Surveillance\n* Entrance Gate With Security\n* 24/7 Security\n* Access Controlled Lift\n\n* Mo Sewage Treatment Plant\n* Eco Life\n* Drip Irrigation System\n* Rainwater Harvesting\n\n* Marble flooring\n* Modular kitchen\n* Premium sanitary and CP fittings\n* Vitrified tile flooring\n* Stainless steel sink\n* Concealed Electrification\n* Acrylic Emulsion Paint\n* Concealed Plumbing\n* Multi-stranded cables\n\n## Google Map Location of Samarpan Om Apartment Borivali West\n\n## Locality Overview of Borivali West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n[Borivali West](/location-review/mumbai/borivali-west-real-estate-guide) is a fast-developing residential area in Mumbai, preferred for its open surroundings and improving connectivity. The locality offers access to daily conveniences such as schools, healthcare facilities, and retail options within the broader Borivali West region.\n\nWith increasing residential development and infrastructure growth, Borivali West is often considered by buyers looking for affordable housing and long-term value.\n\n## RERA QR codes\n\n---\n\nSamarpan Om Apartment is a real estate project registered under Maharashtra Real Estate Regulatory Authority, ensuring transparency and accountability in its development. Scan the RERA QR code or search for the project here: <https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/>\n\n---\n\nRera No.:  [P51800025172](https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/projects-search-result?certificate_no=P51800025172)\n\nProject: Samarpan Om Apartment\n\n## Explore Neighbourhood Samarpan Om Apartment Borivali West\n\n---\n\n* St Rock’s College\n* Gokhale College\n* Everest College\n* St. Lawrence Junior College\n\n* Ashwini Ayurvedic Hopsital\n* Shree Ganesha Hospital\n* Phoenix Hospital\n* Lotus Multispecialty Hospital\n\n* Dreams the Mall\n* Metro Mall\n* Reliance Digital\n* Westside\n\n* Tandoor Chai\n* Madrasi Kaapi House\n* Jinu's Corner\n* Domino's Pizza\n\n![Samarpan Homes & Developers](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Developer/FirmLogos/logo-1740838003.webp)\n\n## [Samarpan Homes & Developers](/mumbai/sale/builder/samarpan-homes-developers-1138)\n\nOngoing Projects: 4\n\nCompleted Projects: 6\n\nTotal Projects: 10\n\n---\n\nSamarpan Homes & Development is a well-established construction company with a 15-year history in the industry. The company has a strong reputation for quality assurance and expertise in redevelopment. Their primary focus is to provide their customers with homes that offer access to maximum amenities.  \n  \nAs a builder, Samarpan Homes & Development is committed to the betterment of their customers, as evidenced by their new project aimed at developing green home technologies. This focus on sustainability and innovation is a testament to their dedication to providing their clients with the best possible homes. Overall, Samarpan Homes & Development is a reliable and experienced builder that prioritizes quality, innovation, and customer satisfaction.  \n  \n[Properties in Mumbai by Samarpan Homes & Developers](https://houssed.com/mumbai/sale/builder/samarpan-homes-developers-1138)\n\n## FAQ's about Samarpan Om Apartment Borivali West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n## Popular Real Estate Searches\n\n### Browse Homes in Borivali West\n\n* [Affordable Homes in Borivali West](/mumbai-borivali.west/sale/flats/segment/affordable)\n* [Luxury Homes in Borivali West](/mumbai-borivali.west/sale/flats/segment/luxury)\n* [Premium Homes in Borivali West](/mumbai-borivali.west/sale/flats/segment/premium)\n* [Ultra Luxury Homes in Borivali West](/mumbai-borivali.west/sale/flats/segment/ultra-luxury)\n\n### Discover Homes in Borivali West\n\n* [Apartments in Borivali West](/mumbai-borivali.west/sale/flats/property/flat)\n* [Duplex in Borivali West](/mumbai-borivali.west/sale/flats/property/duplex)\n* [Studio Apartment in Borivali West](/mumbai-borivali.west/sale/flats/property/studio-apartment)\n\n### Explore Projects in Borivali West\n\n* [New Projects in Borivali West](/mumbai-borivali.west/sale/flats/possession/new-projects)\n* [Ready To Move Projects in Borivali West](/mumbai-borivali.west/sale/flats/possession/ready-to-move)\n\n### Homes by BHK in Borivali West\n\n* [1BHK Homes in Borivali West](/mumbai-borivali.west/sale/flats/1bhk)\n* [2BHK Homes in Borivali West](/mumbai-borivali.west/sale/flats/2bhk)\n* [3BHK Homes in Borivali West](/mumbai-borivali.west/sale/flats/3bhk)\n* [4+ BHK Homes in Borivali West](/mumbai-borivali.west/sale/flats/4-plus-bhk)\n* [4BHK Homes in Borivali West](/mumbai-borivali.west/sale/flats/4bhk)\n\n### Homes by Budget in Borivali West\n\n* [Homes in Borivali West Above 5 Cr](/mumbai-borivali.west/sale/flats/budget/above-5-cr)\n* [Homes in Borivali West Between 1 Cr to 2 Cr](/mumbai-borivali.west/sale/flats/budget/between-1-cr-to-2-cr)\n* [Homes in Borivali West Between 2 Cr to 5 Cr](/mumbai-borivali.west/sale/flats/budget/between-2-cr-to-5-cr)\n* [Homes in Borivali West Between 50 Lakh to 1 Cr](/mumbai-borivali.west/sale/flats/budget/between-50-lakh-to-1-cr)\n\n### Homes by View in Borivali West\n\n* [Open View Homes in Borivali West](/mumbai-borivali.west/sale/flats/property-view/open-view)\n\n### Explore Nearby Localities\n\n* [Homes in Borivali East](/mumbai-borivali.east/sale/flats)\n* [Homes in Borivali West](/mumbai-borivali.west/sale/flats)\n* [Homes in Dahisar East](/mumbai-dahisar.east/sale/flats)\n* [Homes in Dahisar West](/mumbai-dahisar.west/sale/flats)\n\n ","images":[]},{"url":"https://housiey.com/projects/samarpan-om-shri-jagannath","title":"Samarpan Om Shri Jagannath Borivali West - Brochure, Prons&Cons, PriceSheet.","raw_content":"Samarpan Om Shri Jagannath Borivali West - Brochure, Prons&Cons, PriceSheet.\n\n[Home](/)\n[Mumbai](/in/mumbai)\n\n>\n\n[Borivali West](/in/mumbai/borivali-west)\n\nLast updated: Jul 11, 2026\n\n![Project image 1](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/samarpan-om-shri-jagannath_1741326406243-960695216-1280w.webp)![Project image 2](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/samarpan-om-shri-jagannath_1741326403837-416399967-1280w.webp)![Project image 3](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/samarpan-om-shri-jagannath_1741326403908-643666135-1280w.webp)![Project image 4](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/samarpan-om-shri-jagannath_1741326403956-728720481-1280w.webp)![Project image 5](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/samarpan-om-shri-jagannath_1741326404060-127285987-1280w.webp)![Project image 6](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/samarpan-om-shri-jagannath_1741326404116-447893609-1280w.webp)![Project image 7](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/samarpan-om-shri-jagannath_1741326404152-715293514-1280w.webp)![Project image 8](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/samarpan-om-shri-jagannath_1741326404239-136399854-1280w.webp)\n\n# Samarpan Om Shri Jagannath Borivali West\n\n[By Samarpan Homes and Developers](/builder/samarpan-homes-and-developers)|\n\nPai Nagar, [Borivali West](/in/mumbai/borivali-west)\n\n₹1.63 Cr - 3.31 Cr All inc.\n\n![Samarpan Om Shri Jagannath Borivali West - main project image](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/samarpan-om-shri-jagannath_1741326406243-960695216-1280w.webp)\n\n![Samarpan Om Shri Jagannath Borivali West - image 2](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/samarpan-om-shri-jagannath_1741326403837-416399967-1280w.webp)\n\n![Samarpan Om Shri Jagannath Borivali West - image 3](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/samarpan-om-shri-jagannath_1741326403908-643666135-1280w.webp)\n\n![Samarpan Om Shri Jagannath Borivali West - image 4](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/samarpan-om-shri-jagannath_1741326403956-728720481-1280w.webp)\n\n![Samarpan Om Shri Jagannath Borivali West - image 5](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/samarpan-om-shri-jagannath_1741326404060-127285987-1280w.webp)\n\n3+ more\n\nWatch This Project Reel\n\nSee highlights of Samarpan Om Shri Jagannath\n\n[View Full Reel](/reels)\n\nExplore More Reelsin Borivali West\n\nWatch reels of other projects in the same locality\n\n[Watch All Reels](/reels)\n\nWatch This Project Reel\n\nSee highlights of Samarpan Om Shri Jagannath\n\n[View Full Reel](/reels)\n\nExplore More Reelsin Borivali West\n\nWatch reels of other projects in the same locality\n\n[Watch All Reels](/reels)\n\n## Samarpan Om Shri Jagannath Overview\n\n![Land Parcel](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fland-parcel-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\n0.3 acres\n\nLand Parcel\n\n![Towers](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fnumber-of-towers-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\n1\n\nTowers\n\n![Floors](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fnumber-of-floors-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nG+2P+18\n\nFloors\n\n![Config](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fconfig-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\n1, 2, 3 BHK\n\nConfig\n\n![Carpet Area](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fcarpet-area-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\n455-909 sqft\n\nCarpet Area\n\n![RERA NO.](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2FRERA-number-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nP51800054351\n\nRERA NO.\n\n![Possession Status](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fpossession-status-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nReady To Move\n\nPossession Status\n\n![Target Possession](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Ftarget-possession-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nJun 2026\n\nTarget Possession\n\n![RERA Possession](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2FRERA-possession-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nMay 2027\n\nRERA Possession\n\n![Litigation](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Flitigation-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nNo\n\nLitigation\n\n### About Samarpan Om Shri Jagannath\n\nSamarpan Borivali West Project Overview  \nSamarpan Om Shri Jagannath will be constructed on 0.30 acre of land parcel, 1 tower with G+2P+18 floors having 1 BHK, 2 BHK, 3 BHK premium residences.  \n  \nSamarpan Om Shri Jagannath location  \nProject is located Near S.V Rd, Pai Nagar, Borivali West, Mumbai with -  \nBorivali Railway Station - 450m  \nApex Hospital - 1.3km  \nWEH - 1.4km  \n  \nSamarpan Om Shri Jagannath Borivali West Project Amenities  \nFirst is Internal amenities -  \nVitrified Tiles, Branded Fittings, Kitchen Platform & many more  \n  \nSamarpan Homes and Developers Borivali West External Amenities  \nProject has 15+ luxurious with likes of -  \nGymnasium  \nKids Play Area  \nSenior Citizen Area  \nJogging Track  \nYoga Room & Many More  \n  \nSamarpan Homes and Developers Om Shri Jagannath Borivali West Parking -  \nProject has one type of car parking facility -  \n1) Podium Parking  \n  \nSamarpan Om Shri Jagannath Possession -  \nRera Possession - May 2027  \nTarget Possession - June 2026  \n  \nCarpet Area & Floor Plan  \nSamarpan Om Shri Jagannath Borivali West project has 1BHK, 2BHK, 3BHK premium residences with -  \n1BHK - 455 sqft  \n2BHK - (676 to 729) sqft  \n3BHK - (845 to 909)  \n  \nSamarpan Om Shri Jagannath floor plan  \nTower floor plan will have 4 flats 3 lifts & 1 staircase on each floor  \n  \nOm Shri Jagannath Borivali West project sample flat is not ready to view at the site.  \n  \nSamarpan Om Shri Jagannath Mumbai Prices & its details can be found in the price section & Samarpan Om Shri Jagannath Borivali West brochure can be downloaded from the link mentioned below. Project has been praised by the home buyers & Samarpan Homes and Developers Borivali West review is 4 out of 5 from over all the clients who have visited the site.\n\n## Samarpan Om Shri Jagannath Location\n\nNear S.V Rd, Pai Nagar, Borivali West, Mumbai\n\n* Borivali Railway Station - 450m\n* Apex Hospital - 1.3km\n* WEH - 1.4km\n\n![360 background](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2F360-background-image.webp&w=1280&q=75)\n\n![Housiey Logo](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Flogo1.png&w=256&q=75)\n\n![360](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2F360-tour-icon.png&w=128&q=75)\n\n## Samarpan Om Shri Jagannath Videos\n\n## Samarpan Om Shri Jagannath Pros & Cons\n\n![Pros-icon](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fthumbs-up-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nPros\n\n![toggle-arrow](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Farrow-down-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\n1.The project is strategically located near S.V. Road, offering excellent connectivity to Borivali Railway Station, the Western Express Highway, and other key destinations.\n\n2.The project offers a generously sized 1BHK with a carpet area of 455 sq. ft., which is a rare find in today’s market where most developers focus on compact layouts. If spacious living is your preference, this project is an ideal choice.\n\n![Cons-icon](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fthumbs-down-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nCons\n\n![toggle-arrow](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Farrow-down-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\n1.The project offers limited amenities and does not include features such as a swimming pool or clubhouse. If comprehensive amenities are a priority for you, this project may not be the best fit.\n\n2.The apartments do not feature balconies, so if having a private outdoor space is important to you, this project may not be the right fit.\n\n## Samarpan Om Shri Jagannath Amenities\n\n### Internal Amenities\n\n![Vitrified Tiles](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1652438961711-img.webp)\n\nVitrified Tiles\n\n![Granite Kitchen Platform](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/granite-kitchen-platform_External_1770712604025-330259421.webp)\n\nGranite Kitchen Platform\n\n![Branded Fittings](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/branded-fittings_External_1770712154619-248942722.webp)\n\nBranded Fittings\n\n### External Amenities\n\n![Kids Play Area](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1652446278292-img.webp)\n\nKids Play Area\n\n![Jogging Track](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/jogging-track_External_1770724897454-7779386.webp)\n\nJogging Track\n\n![Senior Citizen Area](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1652446899508-img.webp)\n\nSenior Citizen Area\n\n![Rooftop Deck](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/rooftop-deck_External_1770725352429-127606340.webp)\n\nRooftop Deck\n\n![Seating Area](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/seating-area_External_1770882751990-34368358.webp)\n\nSeating Area\n\n![Gymnasium](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/gymnasium_External_1770730220696-33756910.webp)\n\nGymnasium\n\n![SkyWalk](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/skywalk_External_1770891999843-447240810.webp)\n\nSkyWalk\n\n## Samarpan Om Shri Jagannath Master & Floor Plan\n\n### Master Plan\n\n![Samarpan Om Shri Jagannath Master Plan](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/samarpan-om-shri-jagannath_1741326404363-734092138-1280w.webp)\n\n### Floor Plan\n\n![Samarpan Om Shri Jagannath Floor plan 1](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/samarpan-om-shri-jagannath_1741326404432-295467117.webp)![Samarpan Om Shri Jagannath Floor plan 2](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/samarpan-om-shri-jagannath_1741326404530-176444395.webp)\n\n## Samarpan Om Shri Jagannath Pricing & Unit Plans\n\n| Carpet Area | All Inc. Price  (Inc. of Taxes & Charges) | Min Downpayment  (Inc. Taxes) | Parking | Unit Plan |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 455 sqft | 1.63 Cr All In | 24.00 Lacs | 1 |\n\nCarpet:455 sqft\n\n![Unit plan - 455 sq.ft.](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/unit_plans/image_0.webp_1741327232532-489075311.webp)\n\n1.63 CrAll Inc. Price(Inc. of Taxes & Charges)\n\n24.00 Lacs\n\nMin Downpayment(Inclusive Taxes)\n\n1Parking\n\nDown Payment\n\nLoan Amount\n\nInterest\n\nDuration\n\n₹0EMI\n\n## Samarpan Om Shri Jagannath Payment Scheme\n\nRegular Standard Slabwise Payment as per construction, Maximum loan possible up to 90%\n\n## Samarpan Om Shri Jagannath Litigation Details\n\nIs there any litigation against this proposed project:\n\nNo\n\n## Documents For Samarpan Om Shri Jagannath\n\n![category icon](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Flegal-paper-icon.png&w=64&q=75)\n\n### Commencement Certificate\n\n![pdf icon](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fpdf-icon.png&w=64&q=75)\n\nSamarpan Om Shri Jagannath Commencement Certificate\n\n![category icon](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Flegal-paper-icon.png&w=64&q=75)\n\n### Legal Title Report\n\n![pdf icon](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fpdf-icon.png&w=64&q=75)\n\nSamarpan Om Shri Jagannath Legal Title Report\n\n![category icon](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Flegal-paper-icon.png&w=64&q=75)\n\n### Layout Plan\n\n![pdf icon](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fpdf-icon.png&w=64&q=75)\n\nSamarpan Om Shri Jagannath Layout Plan\n\nNote: You can download more detailed documents by following this [link](https://maharerait.maharashtra.gov.in/public/project/view/45661)\n\n## Samarpan Om Shri Jagannath QR Codes\n\n[![RERA QR code - P51800054351](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/RERA-QR-images/rera_qr_code_1741162340344-240511969.webp)\n\nP51800054351](https://maharerait.maharashtra.gov.in/public/project/view/45661)\n\n## Project approved by\n\n## About Samarpan Homes and Developers\n\nSamarpan Homes and Developers\n\n![Samarpan Homes and Developers](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/builders/logo--1717737431059-img.webp)\n\n2 CitiesLocations\n\nMumbai CityMumbai suburban\n\n20 yearsExperience\n\n6Total Projects\n\nWe are in the business of building spaces worthy of dreams and trust. Homes and commercial spaces all over Mumbai built with innovation and integrity. Samarpan Homes & Developers& Developers , a part of the Shree Shanti Group has been in the business for over 8 decades. That’s the goodwill of over a thousand happy clients and partners residing across 9.5 million square feet area of residential and commercial spaces. People who now know they can trust us with their dreams.\n\n## Frequently Asked Question\n\nYes, a sample flat is available for viewing. Currently, the 2BHK show flat is ready and can be visited. Book a free site visit through Housiey and our team will arrange everything.\n\nThe expected possession date is **01 May 2027** as per RERA. Construction is currently **90%** complete as of July 11, 2026. Target possession is **01 June 2026**.\n\nYes, it is RERA registered. The RERA number is **P51800054351**.  \nYou can verify it on the official RERA portal: <https://maharerait.maharashtra.gov.in/public/project/view/45661>\n\nNo, it has no pending litigation. All legal documents including the Commencement Certificate and Legal Title Report are available on Housiey for review before booking.\n\nThe following legal documents are available on Housiey: **Commencement Certificate**, **Legal Title Report**, **Layout Plan**, **Proforma Allotment Letter**, **Proforma Sale Agreement**. You can preview them directly on the project page or verify them independently on the official RERA portal using RERA number **P51800054351**.\n\nThis project offers **10+** amenities. Key external amenities include SkyWalk, Gymnasium, Seating Area, Rooftop Deck, and Senior Citizen Area.  \n Internal specifications include Branded Fittings and Granite Kitchen Platform. The complete amenities list is available on Housiey.\n\nMonthly maintenance details are available in the price sheet. You can download it from the project page on Housiey.\n\nIn Samarpan Om Shri Jagannath, the 1BHK units are available in the following carpet area options:  \n• **455 sq. ft.**  \nEach configuration may differ slightly in layout, balcony size, or orientation. Our team can walk you through floor plans for each option during your consultation or site visit.\n\nIn Samarpan Om Shri Jagannath, the 2BHK units are available in the following carpet area options:  \n• **676 sq. ft.**  \n• **729 sq. ft.**  \nEach configuration may differ slightly in layout, balcony size, or orientation. Our team can walk you through floor plans for each option during your consultation or site visit.\n\nIn Samarpan Om Shri Jagannath, the 3BHK units are available in the following carpet area options:  \n• **845 sq. ft.**  \n• **909 sq. ft.**  \nEach configuration may differ slightly in layout, balcony size, or orientation. Our team can walk you through floor plans for each option during your consultation or site visit.\n\nThe all-inclusive price of a 1BHK in Samarpan Om Shri Jagannath starts from **₹1.63 Cr** and varies depending on the carpet area and floor level you choose.   \n• **455 sq. ft.** – ₹1.63 Cr (all-inclusive)  \nThe price includes the base cost, applicable stamp duty, registration charges, GST, and possession charges. Final pricing may vary based on unit configuration, selected floor, and availability.\n\nThe all-inclusive price of a 2BHK in Samarpan Om Shri Jagannath starts from **₹2.36 Cr** and varies depending on the carpet area and floor level you choose.   \n• **676 sq. ft.** – ₹2.36 Cr (all-inclusive)  \n• **729 sq. ft.** – ₹2.70 Cr (all-inclusive)  \nThe price includes the base cost, applicable stamp duty, registration charges, GST, and possession charges. Final pricing may vary based on unit configuration, selected floor, and availability.\n\nThe all-inclusive price of a 3BHK in Samarpan Om Shri Jagannath starts from **₹3.10 Cr** and varies depending on the carpet area and floor level you choose.   \n• **845 sq. ft.** – ₹3.10 Cr (all-inclusive)  \n• **909 sq. ft.** – ₹3.31 Cr (all-inclusive)  \nThe price includes the base cost, applicable stamp duty, registration charges, GST, and possession charges. Final pricing may vary based on unit configuration, selected floor, and availability.\n\nIt is built across **0.3 acres** with **1** towers with **G+2P+18** floors. Each floor has **4** flats per floor, **3** lifts, **1** staircases. It is available in **1BHK/2BHK/3BHK** configurations with carpet areas ranging from **455** to **909 sq. ft.**\n\nSamarpan Om Shri Jagannath provides dedicated car parking facilities for residents. The exact parking type and the number of spaces allotted per unit are mentioned in the Unit Plan, which you can download for free on the Samarpan Om Shri Jagannath project page on Housiey.\n\nIt is located at **Near S.V Rd, Pai Nagar, Borivali West, Mumbai**.  \nNearby landmarks include:  \n**• Borivali Railway Station - 450m**   \n**• Apex Hospital - 1.3km**   \n**• WEH - 1.4km**\n\nThe following payment plans are available:  \n• **CLP ( Construction Link plan)** - Regular Standard Slabwise Payment as per construction, Maximum loan possible up to 90%  \n  \n**Note:** In some cases, payment plan deviations can be considered based on your preferred terms. The final schedule is confirmed after your site visit.\n\nThe minimum down payment starts from **₹24.00 Lacs**, inclusive of all taxes. EMI options are also available. Use the EMI calculator on the project page to check monthly instalments based on your loan amount and tenure.\n\nYes, it is approved by leading banks including **Central Bank of India**, **Union Bank of India**, **Bank Of India**, **Bank Of Baroda**, **Citi Bank**, **Kotak Mahindra Bank**, **Axis Bank**, **State Bank Of India**, **ICICI Bank**, **HDFC BANK**. The complete approved bank list is available in the Banks section on Housiey. Home loan eligibility depends on the bank's lending policy and your profile.\n\nNo - Housiey follows a strict no-brokerage policy. You pay only the builder's official price - no commission, no hidden charges, and no middlemen. This applies to all projects listed on Housiey.\n\nIt is developed by **Samarpan Homes and Developers**, a trusted real estate brand with over **20 years** of experience and more than **6 completed projects** across **Mumbai City and Mumbai suburban**.  \n**Some of their notable developments include:**  \n  \n • **Samarpan Swanand** in Borivali East, Mumbai  \n  \n • **Samarpan Sankalp** in Borivali East, Mumbai  \n  \n • **Samarpan Rajdeep** in Borivali East, Mumbai  \n  \n • **Samarpan Megh Mahal** in Borivali East, Mumbai  \n  \n • **Samarpan Anand** in Borivali East, Mumbai\n\nYes, the Commencement Certificate and Legal Title Report are available on Housiey. You can download them from the Documents section or verify them on the RERA portal.\n\nYes - book a free site visit through Housiey. We arrange a free Ola cab pickup and drop from your location.  \n  \nAlternatively, you can schedule an online project presentation directly by the builder from home. Both options are 100% free with no obligation to buy.\n\nYes - NRIs can purchase this project under FEMA regulations. Payment can be made via NRE or NRO accounts. Home loans are available from Indian banks with a co-applicant. Housiey's team assists NRI buyers with documentation and Power of Attorney requirements remotely - 100% free.\n\n**Borivali West** is one of Mumbai's sought-after micro-markets with consistent property appreciation.  \n  \nThis project by **Samarpan Homes and Developers** - with 20 years of experience - offers 1BHK/2BHK/3BHK at ₹1.63 Cr to ₹3.31 Cr, making it a strong long-term investment opportunity.\n\nBuying through Housiey gives you:  \n(1) No brokerage - you pay the builder's exact price  \n(2) Free Ola cab site visit  \n(3) Online project presentation by the builder from home  \n(4) Free legal consultation via Housiey Legal  \n(5) Honest Pros & Cons review on every project  \nAll services are 100% free with no obligation.\n\nThe price sheet and brochure for this project are available for free download on Housiey. Click the \"Price Sheet\" or \"Brochure\" button on the project page. No registration is required for instant download.\n\nHousiey has a **4.8 rating** on Google with **2,395+ reviews**.  \n  \nOver **8,500 families** have purchased homes through Housiey across **8+ cities** with no brokerage and direct builder pricing. Housiey has conducted **1.2 lakh+ free site visits** and facilitated over **₹8,000 crore** worth of property transactions.\n\n## Explore Related Projects\n\n![DSD Aura](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/DSD_Aura_Elevation--1694329813038-img-1280w.webp)\n\n[### DSD Aura](/projects/dsd-aura)\n\n₹ 4.70 Cr (All inc)\n\n[DSD Group](/builder/dsd-group)\n\n890- 1941sqft\n\nBorivali West\n\nReady\n\n3BHKLimited\n\n1230sqft\n\n₹4.70 Cr\n\n2BHKSold Out\n\n890sqft\n\n-\n\n3BHKSold Out\n\n1200sqft\n\n-\n\n3BHKSold Out\n\n1309sqft\n\n-\n\n4BHKSold Out\n\n1420sqft\n\n-\n\